{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>to their lord, the king of Egypt</b> Two times in the Masorah: here and the other: האומרות לאדוניהם הביאה ונשתה. Just as there it concerns drinking, so too here it concerns drinking, as the Rabbis interpreted that a fly was found in his cup."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:02.927117471Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}